&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# PyTorch를 이용한 간단한 Transformer 블록 구현 예시&lt;/span&gt;
